    "name": "LOS - Customer Onboarding API",
    "description": "Allianza LOS Individual Customer Onboarding API: step-by-step draft flow (create on step 1, update on every Continue, submit at the end), document upload / replace / delete, listing and authentication.\n\nRun order: 0. Authentication -> 2. Step 1 Create Draft -> Steps 2-4 -> 3. Upload Document(s) -> Steps 6-7 -> Submit.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
