    {
      "name": "2. Customer Onboarding (Draft Flow)",
      "description": "Step-by-step onboarding. The customer is created as a DRAFT on step 1 and every later 'Continue' updates the same customer with PUT.\n\nRules:\n- First Continue (no customerCode yet) -> POST /api/customers. Every later Continue -> PUT /api/customers/{customerCode}.\n- PUT saves ONLY the sections present in the body. A missing section is left as it is.\n- Lists (previousEmployment, taxReturns, loanHistory, references): null/missing = not part of this save, [] = clear all rows.\n- personal must be sent together with family (spouse rules depend on marital status).\n- Masked PAN/Aadhaar/CKYC/account numbers (as returned by GET) mean 'unchanged'.\n- Documents are uploaded during step 5 with the '3. Customer Documents' requests.\n- Submit checks every mandatory step and the required documents, then sets onboardingStatus = COMPLETED.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Step 1 - Personal Details: Create Draft",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "customers"
              ]
            },
            "description": "First 'Continue' on step 1. Requires personal, identity and family. Runs the duplicate checks (PAN, Aadhaar, mobile, email), generates the customer code and creates the customer with onboardingStatus = DRAFT. The customerCode is saved to the collection variable.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"branchId\": 1,\n  \"leadId\": null,\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"title\": \"1000801\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Rajesh\",\n    \"middleName\": \"Kumar\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Sharma\",\n    \"dob\": \"1990-05-15\",\n    \"gender\": \"1000901\",\n    \"maritalStatus\": \"1001101\",\n    \"customerType\": \"1001201\",\n    \"kycStatus\": \"1001301\",\n    \"occupation\": \"Software Engineer\",\n    \"mobile\": \"9876543210\",\n    \"alternateContact\": \"9876543211\",\n    \"email\": \"rajesh.sharma@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"panNumber\": \"ABCDE1234F\",\n    \"aadhaarNumber\": \"123456789012\",\n    \"ckycNumber\": \"12345678901234\"\n  },\n  \"family\": {\n    \"fatherTitle\": \"1000801\",\n    \"fatherFirstName\": \"Ramesh\",\n    \"fatherMiddleName\": \"Chandra\",\n    \"fatherLastName\": \"Sharma\",\n    \"motherTitle\": \"1000802\",\n    \"motherFirstName\": \"Sunita\",\n    \"motherLastName\": \"Sharma\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.customerCode) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"customerCode\", json.data.customerCode);",
                  "        console.log(\"Saved customerCode: \" + json.data.customerCode);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Draft created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.onboardingStatus).to.eql(\"DRAFT\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Step 1 - Back & Continue again (re-save)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerCode}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "customers",
                "{{customerCode}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "User went back to step 1, changed something and pressed Continue again. Updates the SAME customer (no new customer code). Duplicate checks ignore this customer's own record. Masked identity numbers keep the stored values.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"title\": \"1000801\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Rajeshwar\",\n    \"middleName\": \"Kumar\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Sharma\",\n    \"dob\": \"1990-05-15\",\n    \"gender\": \"1000901\",\n    \"maritalStatus\": \"1001101\",\n    \"customerType\": \"1001201\",\n    \"kycStatus\": \"1001301\",\n    \"occupation\": \"Software Engineer\",\n    \"mobile\": \"9876543210\",\n    \"alternateContact\": \"9876543211\",\n    \"email\": \"rajesh.sharma@example.com\"\n  },\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"panNumber\": \"ABCDE****F\",\n    \"aadhaarNumber\": \"********9012\",\n    \"ckycNumber\": \"**********1234\"\n  },\n  \"family\": {\n    \"fatherTitle\": \"1000801\",\n    \"fatherFirstName\": \"Ramesh\",\n    \"fatherMiddleName\": \"Chandra\",\n    \"fatherLastName\": \"Sharma\",\n    \"motherTitle\": \"1000802\",\n    \"motherFirstName\": \"Sunita\",\n    \"motherLastName\": \"Sharma\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Step saved\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
