                "submit"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Final Submit. Checks that personal, identity, family, address, employment, income, bank and 2 references are saved, and that the required documents are uploaded (app.customer.documents.required-types and min-count). Missing items come back as 400 with errors keyed by step (address, income, documents, documents.<TYPE> ...). On success sets onboardingStatus = COMPLETED, submittedAt and submittedBy. Submitting twice returns 409."
          },
